# Local git

This working copy is **not** a GitHub fork. `upstream` is MaxBittker/rs-sdk (fetch only; push is disabled). There is no `origin`. Do not `git push`, do not add a public remote, and do not restore a push URL to Max's repo.

Daily branch: `private/fleet`. SDK/client patches live on `sdk/local`. To pick up upstream:

```bash
git fetch upstream
git checkout sdk/local && git rebase upstream/main
git checkout private/fleet && git rebase sdk/local
```

Never gitignore `bots/`. Cursor search and the agent need those scripts. Ignore only `bot.env`, `*.log`, `*.pid`, and `assignment.json`.
